  "duration_s": 464.886009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "问你一个问题，中国天眼全世界最大的射电望远镜，它是谁建出来的，我给你三秒钟，甚能说出那人的名字吗？大多数人张了张嘴说不出来，甚至有人觉得这么牛的东西应该是外国人帮我们设计的吧。今天我想让你记住一个名字，难人多，先别急着划走，你先看看这个人值不值得，你用一分钟记住。如果你在大街上遇见他，你大概率认不出来，花白的头发，旧旧的夹克，笑路微微驼背，笑起来像个普通的老大爷。可就是这个老大爷笑了二十二年，把一句当年没人当真的话，变成了让全身世界都仰望的国之重器。天眼fast五百米口径球面射电望远镜中国天眼之父就是他。一九六三年十八岁的南仁东考进清华大学无线电气。那一年，没人知道这个瘦瘦的年轻人，将来会把中国的眼睛送到一百三十七亿光年之外。一百三十七亿光年是什么概念？那是宇宙大爆炸发生的地方，是我们能看到的最远的地方。时间快进到一九九三年九月，国际无线电科学联盟大会在日本东京召开。当时全世界最大的射电望远镜在美国口径三百零五米，我们中国呢最大的射电望远镜口径只有二十五米，差了十几倍。在会上多个国家科学家们商量说，这东西太难了，要不咱们联合起来建一台更大的注意这个词。联合为什么？联合谁为单靠一个国家，谁都不敢拍胸脯，说我能造出来。可就在这个节骨眼上，中国代表团的房间里走进来。一个男人他推门进去说，我说了一句让所有人愣住的话，我们也见一个。这句话就是南仁都说的，你品品这个画面，一个当时连科研经费都紧张的国家，一个国内最大望远镜口径只有二十五米的国家站出来说要造口径五百米的世界第一射电望远镜在场的人什么反应？有人客气的笑了笑，有人心里直摇头，说梦话吧。连我们自己人一开始都不太信，可南仁东当真哪，这一当真就是二十二年。这里有个细节，你先别急着说他傻。当时南仁东人在日本在日本国立天文台做研究，人家给他开出的薪资待遇比国内高出三百倍三百倍啊，什么概念？你感受一下，比如你月薪一万，人家一个月给你三百万，可他呢辞了职，直接回国，一点没犹豫。有人问他，你图什么呢？他没怎么解释。此后的二十二年，他的行动就是答案，他把自己埋进了贵州的深山。说到这儿，你可能还不清楚天眼到底有多牛。我给你讲几个数，你就明白了。天眼直径五百米，你绕着它走一圈儿都要半个钟头，他的反射面二十五万平方米，相当于三十个标准的足球场那么大。再给你一个画面，假如把天眼盛满水，全世界七十亿人，每个人能分到四平，他是世界上最大的单口径射电望远镜，综合性能领先全球二十年以上。有了它，哪怕有人在月球上打电话，我们都能听得清清楚楚。而且这个庞然大物从设计到建造，全部都是我们中国人自己完成的。他的出现意味着什么？通信、雷达、深空探测、精密仪器等等，一个国家的科技底盘全都被他支棱起来了。所以当年有人说南仁东不是在造一台望远镜。他是在给中国装一双能看宇宙的眼睛。二零一六年九月二十五日，天眼正式落成启用。那天，世界为之震动，无数人欢呼，而很少有人注意到，人群里有一个瘦削的老人安安静静的站着，他为了这一天等了足足二十二年之久，而那个时候他的生命却已经进入了倒计时。不到一年。二零一七年九月十五日，南仁东走了，享年七十二岁。他生前没当过院士，没什么显赫的头衔。可他去世后，国际天文学联合会把一颗小行星命名为南仁东星。你看天上那颗星，就是他他说过一句话，人这一辈子，总要做一些事情，哪怕只做一件，也要做到极致。他做到了，他用一辈子把天言两个字刻在了中国的星空上。如果你觉得这样的人值得被记住，点个关注这个系列，我会把他的故事一级一级讲完。但我更想跟你说一句，像南仁东这样的人，中国不止一个，你知道中国还有多少这样的脊两吗？李四光逐可珍毛以生钱学森、郭永怀、陈铠甲，他们一个个把命交给国家，可他们的名字，咱们的孩子能叫出几个这本书？国之脊梁，中国院士的科学人生，百年中国科学院学部科学人生，非百年项目组编的四十位院士，三十三个学科领域四十段科学人生，每一个故事都像南仁东一样，让人心口发烫。国家出版基金项目认准正版，每一个故事都像南仁东一样，让人心口发烫。拍一本儿放家里，让孩子翻一翻，孩子心里有了偶像就知道什么值得追。点下方链接，给孩子带一本，也请你点个赞、收藏、转发，让更多人知道中国天眼之父，他叫南仁东。下集预告，为了把天眼建起来，这个老头在贵州的大山里求人求了十一年，他经历了什么？点关注下集见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 1050,
      "text": "问你一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2030,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "中国天眼全世界最大的射电望远镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7330,
      "end_ms": 8950,
      "text": "它是谁建出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "我给你三秒钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12690,
      "end_ms": 14590,
      "text": "甚能说出那人的名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15850,
      "end_ms": 18590,
      "text": "大多数人张了张嘴说不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19170,
      "end_ms": 24630,
      "text": "甚至有人觉得这么牛的东西应该是外国人帮我们设计的吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25390,
      "end_ms": 28050,
      "text": "今天我想让你记住一个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28450,
      "end_ms": 29515,
      "text": "难人多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00010",
      "start_ms": 30450,
      "end_ms": 31610,
      "text": "先别急着划走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32030,
      "end_ms": 34310,
      "text": "你先看看这个人值不值得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34310,
      "end_ms": 35870,
      "text": "你用一分钟记住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36390,
      "end_ms": 38190,
      "text": "如果你在大街上遇见他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38290,
      "end_ms": 39690,
      "text": "你大概率认不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40890,
      "end_ms": 42030,
      "text": "花白的头发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42850,
      "end_ms": 44250,
      "text": "旧旧的夹克，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00017",
      "start_ms": 45190,
      "end_ms": 46870,
      "text": "笑路微微驼背，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47650,
      "end_ms": 50290,
      "text": "笑起来像个普通的老大爷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51190,
      "end_ms": 55010,
      "text": "可就是这个老大爷笑了二十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55530,
      "end_ms": 58010,
      "text": "把一句当年没人当真的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00021",
      "start_ms": 58270,
      "end_ms": 62335,
      "text": "变成了让全身世界都仰望的国之重器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00022",
      "start_ms": 63230,
      "end_ms": 71345,
      "text": "天眼fast五百米口径球面射电望远镜中国天眼之父就是他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71970,
      "end_ms": 77515,
      "text": "一九六三年十八岁的南仁东考进清华大学无线电气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00024",
      "start_ms": 77920,
      "end_ms": 78395,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00025",
      "start_ms": 78620,
      "end_ms": 80905,
      "text": "没人知道这个瘦瘦的年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00026",
      "start_ms": 81230,
      "end_ms": 88385,
      "text": "将来会把中国的眼睛送到一百三十七亿光年之外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00027",
      "start_ms": 89310,
      "end_ms": 91825,
      "text": "一百三十七亿光年是什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00028",
      "start_ms": 93550,
      "end_ms": 95515,
      "text": "那是宇宙大爆炸发生的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00029",
      "start_ms": 96080,
      "end_ms": 99065,
      "text": "是我们能看到的最远的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00030",
      "start_ms": 100060,
      "end_ms": 103285,
      "text": "时间快进到一九九三年九月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00031",
      "start_ms": 104150,
      "end_ms": 107914,
      "text": "国际无线电科学联盟大会在日本东京召开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00032",
      "start_ms": 108860,
      "end_ms": 115935,
      "text": "当时全世界最大的射电望远镜在美国口径三百零五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00033",
      "start_ms": 117210,
      "end_ms": 121520,
      "text": "我们中国呢最大的射电望远镜口径只有二十五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00034",
      "start_ms": 121680,
      "end_ms": 122900,
      "text": "差了十几倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00035",
      "start_ms": 123340,
      "end_ms": 126380,
      "text": "在会上多个国家科学家们商量说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00036",
      "start_ms": 126620,
      "end_ms": 127860,
      "text": "这东西太难了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00037",
      "start_ms": 128140,
      "end_ms": 132780,
      "text": "要不咱们联合起来建一台更大的注意这个词。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00038",
      "start_ms": 133160,
      "end_ms": 134900,
      "text": "联合为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00039",
      "start_ms": 134900,
      "end_ms": 137260,
      "text": "联合谁为单靠一个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00040",
      "start_ms": 137640,
      "end_ms": 139300,
      "text": "谁都不敢拍胸脯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00041",
      "start_ms": 139300,
      "end_ms": 140920,
      "text": "说我能造出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00042",
      "start_ms": 141780,
      "end_ms": 143360,
      "text": "可就在这个节骨眼上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00043",
      "start_ms": 143740,
      "end_ms": 147060,
      "text": "中国代表团的房间里走进来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00044",
      "start_ms": 147060,
      "end_ms": 149740,
      "text": "一个男人他推门进去说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00045",
      "start_ms": 149740,
      "end_ms": 152130,
      "text": "我说了一句让所有人愣住的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00046",
      "start_ms": 152970,
      "end_ms": 154050,
      "text": "我们也见一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00047",
      "start_ms": 155250,
      "end_ms": 158430,
      "text": "这句话就是南仁都说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00048",
      "start_ms": 158510,
      "end_ms": 159910,
      "text": "你品品这个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00049",
      "start_ms": 160330,
      "end_ms": 163330,
      "text": "一个当时连科研经费都紧张的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00050",
      "start_ms": 163910,
      "end_ms": 175530,
      "text": "一个国内最大望远镜口径只有二十五米的国家站出来说要造口径五百米的世界第一射电望远镜在场的人什么反应？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00051",
      "start_ms": 175810,
      "end_ms": 177330,
      "text": "有人客气的笑了笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00052",
      "start_ms": 177470,
      "end_ms": 178770,
      "text": "有人心里直摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00053",
      "start_ms": 178970,
      "end_ms": 179815,
      "text": "说梦话吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00054",
      "start_ms": 180570,
      "end_ms": 183910,
      "text": "连我们自己人一开始都不太信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00055",
      "start_ms": 184910,
      "end_ms": 186550,
      "text": "可南仁东当真哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00056",
      "start_ms": 187090,
      "end_ms": 189370,
      "text": "这一当真就是二十二年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00057",
      "start_ms": 189910,
      "end_ms": 190970,
      "text": "这里有个细节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00058",
      "start_ms": 191450,
      "end_ms": 193010,
      "text": "你先别急着说他傻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00059",
      "start_ms": 193190,
      "end_ms": 197490,
      "text": "当时南仁东人在日本在日本国立天文台做研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00060",
      "start_ms": 198130,
      "end_ms": 203130,
      "text": "人家给他开出的薪资待遇比国内高出三百倍三百倍啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00061",
      "start_ms": 203450,
      "end_ms": 204130,
      "text": "什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00062",
      "start_ms": 204210,
      "end_ms": 205150,
      "text": "你感受一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00063",
      "start_ms": 205630,
      "end_ms": 206830,
      "text": "比如你月薪一万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00064",
      "start_ms": 207110,
      "end_ms": 208630,
      "text": "人家一个月给你三百万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00065",
      "start_ms": 209510,
      "end_ms": 211160,
      "text": "可他呢辞了职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00066",
      "start_ms": 211420,
      "end_ms": 212240,
      "text": "直接回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00067",
      "start_ms": 212660,
      "end_ms": 213680,
      "text": "一点没犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00068",
      "start_ms": 213920,
      "end_ms": 214680,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00069",
      "start_ms": 216300,
      "end_ms": 217260,
      "text": "你图什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00070",
      "start_ms": 218240,
      "end_ms": 219520,
      "text": "他没怎么解释。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00071",
      "start_ms": 220080,
      "end_ms": 221440,
      "text": "此后的二十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00072",
      "start_ms": 221580,
      "end_ms": 223100,
      "text": "他的行动就是答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00073",
      "start_ms": 223820,
      "end_ms": 228650,
      "text": "他把自己埋进了贵州的深山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00074",
      "start_ms": 228830,
      "end_ms": 229590,
      "text": "说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00075",
      "start_ms": 229590,
      "end_ms": 232490,
      "text": "你可能还不清楚天眼到底有多牛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00076",
      "start_ms": 233150,
      "end_ms": 234290,
      "text": "我给你讲几个数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00077",
      "start_ms": 234290,
      "end_ms": 235470,
      "text": "你就明白了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00078",
      "start_ms": 235470,
      "end_ms": 238090,
      "text": "天眼直径五百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00079",
      "start_ms": 238090,
      "end_ms": 241655,
      "text": "你绕着它走一圈儿都要半个钟头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00080",
      "start_ms": 242150,
      "end_ms": 244935,
      "text": "他的反射面二十五万平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00081",
      "start_ms": 245290,
      "end_ms": 248445,
      "text": "相当于三十个标准的足球场那么大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00082",
      "start_ms": 248900,
      "end_ms": 249915,
      "text": "再给你一个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00083",
      "start_ms": 250470,
      "end_ms": 252375,
      "text": "假如把天眼盛满水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00084",
      "start_ms": 252790,
      "end_ms": 254045,
      "text": "全世界七十亿人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00085",
      "start_ms": 254440,
      "end_ms": 256135,
      "text": "每个人能分到四平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00086",
      "start_ms": 256620,
      "end_ms": 260405,
      "text": "他是世界上最大的单口径射电望远镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00087",
      "start_ms": 261000,
      "end_ms": 263780,
      "text": "综合性能领先全球二十年以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00088",
      "start_ms": 263920,
      "end_ms": 264480,
      "text": "有了它，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00089",
      "start_ms": 264800,
      "end_ms": 266945,
      "text": "哪怕有人在月球上打电话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00090",
      "start_ms": 267290,
      "end_ms": 269485,
      "text": "我们都能听得清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00091",
      "start_ms": 269920,
      "end_ms": 273765,
      "text": "而且这个庞然大物从设计到建造，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00092",
      "start_ms": 274180,
      "end_ms": 276665,
      "text": "全部都是我们中国人自己完成的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00093",
      "start_ms": 277380,
      "end_ms": 278925,
      "text": "他的出现意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00094",
      "start_ms": 279300,
      "end_ms": 283875,
      "text": "通信、雷达、深空探测、精密仪器等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00095",
      "start_ms": 284220,
      "end_ms": 287455,
      "text": "一个国家的科技底盘全都被他支棱起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00096",
      "start_ms": 288740,
      "end_ms": 292895,
      "text": "所以当年有人说南仁东不是在造一台望远镜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00097",
      "start_ms": 293410,
      "end_ms": 297190,
      "text": "他是在给中国装一双能看宇宙的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00098",
      "start_ms": 297490,
      "end_ms": 299770,
      "text": "二零一六年九月二十五日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00099",
      "start_ms": 300250,
      "end_ms": 302330,
      "text": "天眼正式落成启用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00100",
      "start_ms": 302930,
      "end_ms": 303410,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00101",
      "start_ms": 303730,
      "end_ms": 305090,
      "text": "世界为之震动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00102",
      "start_ms": 305350,
      "end_ms": 306530,
      "text": "无数人欢呼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00103",
      "start_ms": 307150,
      "end_ms": 308790,
      "text": "而很少有人注意到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00104",
      "start_ms": 309090,
      "end_ms": 313650,
      "text": "人群里有一个瘦削的老人安安静静的站着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00105",
      "start_ms": 314190,
      "end_ms": 318010,
      "text": "他为了这一天等了足足二十二年之久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00106",
      "start_ms": 318570,
      "end_ms": 322925,
      "text": "而那个时候他的生命却已经进入了倒计时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00107",
      "start_ms": 324850,
      "end_ms": 325650,
      "text": "不到一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00108",
      "start_ms": 325950,
      "end_ms": 328170,
      "text": "二零一七年九月十五日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00109",
      "start_ms": 328590,
      "end_ms": 329670,
      "text": "南仁东走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00110",
      "start_ms": 329810,
      "end_ms": 331050,
      "text": "享年七十二岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00111",
      "start_ms": 331730,
      "end_ms": 334150,
      "text": "他生前没当过院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00112",
      "start_ms": 334370,
      "end_ms": 336010,
      "text": "没什么显赫的头衔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00113",
      "start_ms": 336270,
      "end_ms": 337270,
      "text": "可他去世后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00114",
      "start_ms": 337670,
      "end_ms": 343850,
      "text": "国际天文学联合会把一颗小行星命名为南仁东星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00115",
      "start_ms": 344770,
      "end_ms": 346710,
      "text": "你看天上那颗星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00116",
      "start_ms": 347050,
      "end_ms": 349530,
      "text": "就是他他说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00117",
      "start_ms": 349930,
      "end_ms": 351150,
      "text": "人这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00118",
      "start_ms": 351590,
      "end_ms": 353095,
      "text": "总要做一些事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00119",
      "start_ms": 353440,
      "end_ms": 354595,
      "text": "哪怕只做一件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00120",
      "start_ms": 354920,
      "end_ms": 356185,
      "text": "也要做到极致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00121",
      "start_ms": 356650,
      "end_ms": 357445,
      "text": "他做到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00122",
      "start_ms": 357840,
      "end_ms": 362615,
      "text": "他用一辈子把天言两个字刻在了中国的星空上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00123",
      "start_ms": 364320,
      "end_ms": 367575,
      "text": "如果你觉得这样的人值得被记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00124",
      "start_ms": 367820,
      "end_ms": 369635,
      "text": "点个关注这个系列，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00125",
      "start_ms": 369890,
      "end_ms": 372630,
      "text": "我会把他的故事一级一级讲完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00126",
      "start_ms": 372710,
      "end_ms": 374475,
      "text": "但我更想跟你说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00127",
      "start_ms": 374930,
      "end_ms": 376515,
      "text": "像南仁东这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00128",
      "start_ms": 376900,
      "end_ms": 378285,
      "text": "中国不止一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00129",
      "start_ms": 378800,
      "end_ms": 381270,
      "text": "你知道中国还有多少这样的脊两吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00130",
      "start_ms": 382160,
      "end_ms": 388325,
      "text": "李四光逐可珍毛以生钱学森、郭永怀、陈铠甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00131",
      "start_ms": 388960,
      "end_ms": 391395,
      "text": "他们一个个把命交给国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00132",
      "start_ms": 391920,
      "end_ms": 393160,
      "text": "可他们的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00133",
      "start_ms": 393300,
      "end_ms": 397395,
      "text": "咱们的孩子能叫出几个这本书？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00134",
      "start_ms": 397750,
      "end_ms": 398685,
      "text": "国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00135",
      "start_ms": 399510,
      "end_ms": 401510,
      "text": "中国院士的科学人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00136",
      "start_ms": 401530,
      "end_ms": 404950,
      "text": "百年中国科学院学部科学人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00137",
      "start_ms": 405010,
      "end_ms": 408620,
      "text": "非百年项目组编的四十位院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00138",
      "start_ms": 408780,
      "end_ms": 411935,
      "text": "三十三个学科领域四十段科学人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00139",
      "start_ms": 412650,
      "end_ms": 415295,
      "text": "每一个故事都像南仁东一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00140",
      "start_ms": 415560,
      "end_ms": 416685,
      "text": "让人心口发烫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00141",
      "start_ms": 417430,
      "end_ms": 420215,
      "text": "国家出版基金项目认准正版，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00142",
      "start_ms": 420780,
      "end_ms": 423930,
      "text": "每一个故事都像南仁东一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00143",
      "start_ms": 424090,
      "end_ms": 425565,
      "text": "让人心口发烫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00144",
      "start_ms": 426480,
      "end_ms": 428215,
      "text": "拍一本儿放家里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00145",
      "start_ms": 428430,
      "end_ms": 429725,
      "text": "让孩子翻一翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00146",
      "start_ms": 430560,
      "end_ms": 433905,
      "text": "孩子心里有了偶像就知道什么值得追。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00147",
      "start_ms": 435520,
      "end_ms": 436645,
      "text": "点下方链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00148",
      "start_ms": 437170,
      "end_ms": 438130,
      "text": "给孩子带一本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00149",
      "start_ms": 438230,
      "end_ms": 441125,
      "text": "也请你点个赞、收藏、转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00150",
      "start_ms": 441670,
      "end_ms": 444525,
      "text": "让更多人知道中国天眼之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00151",
      "start_ms": 444810,
      "end_ms": 445715,
      "text": "他叫南仁东。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00152",
      "start_ms": 446000,
      "end_ms": 446815,
      "text": "下集预告，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00153",
      "start_ms": 449380,
      "end_ms": 450875,
      "text": "为了把天眼建起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00154",
      "start_ms": 451770,
      "end_ms": 458795,
      "text": "这个老头在贵州的大山里求人求了十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00155",
      "start_ms": 460000,
      "end_ms": 461065,
      "text": "他经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fcc25656a7e0e573_s00156",
      "start_ms": 463040,
      "end_ms": 464785,
      "text": "点关注下集见。"
    }
  ],
